# gismanager testdata manifest.
#
# Format: <sha256>  <relpath-under-testdata/fetched/>  <url>
# - sha256: lowercase hex
# - relpath: posix path; subdirs allowed (script will mkdir -p)
# - url: must point at an immutable ref (tagged release, signed CDN path)
#
# Run `make fetch-testdata` to download/refresh. The fetched/ directory is
# gitignored — only the manifest and license metadata are tracked.
#
# When adding a new fixture: download it, run `sha256sum <file>`, and append
# a row here. License/source notes go in LICENSES.md.

# --- Vector ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Natural Earth 1:110m admin-0 countries (Shapefile bundle, EPSG:4326).
# Used by ConvertVector tests as the canonical Shapefile→GeoPackage fixture.
0f243aeac8ac6cf26f0417285b0bd33ac47f1b5bdb719fd3e0df37d03ea37110  ne_110m_admin_0_countries.zip  https://naciscdn.org/naturalearth/110m/cultural/ne_110m_admin_0_countries.zip

# Natural Earth 1:110m admin-0 countries (GeoJSON, EPSG:4326).
# Used by ConvertVector reproject + bbox-clip + WHERE-filter tests.
6866c877d39cba9c357620878839b336d569f8c662d3cfab4cb1dbe2d39c977f  ne_110m_admin_0_countries.geojson  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector/v5.1.2/geojson/ne_110m_admin_0_countries.geojson

# --- Raster ---------------------------------------------------------------

