d7cbe932c7ed74a627706a9e9df99f706df3e5abc7d45a49e9d00677a6b09eb4  RGB.byte.tif  https://github.com/rasterio/rasterio/raw/1.4.3/tests/data/RGB.byte.tif

# rio-tiler reference COG fixture (EPSG:32618, ~800 KB).
